  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Start",
      "title": "Five endings, five articles",
      "learn": [
        "-chen and -lein make a smaller form, and the new noun is das. die Flasche → das Fläschchen. das Buch → das Büchlein. The vowel often takes an umlaut.",
        "-er is the man who does the job: pflegen → der Pfleger. -in is the woman: die Pflegerin. der Arzt → die Ärztin, with ä. der Patient → die Patientin, with no umlaut.",
        "-ung is the feminine action: untersuchen → die Untersuchung. behandeln → die Behandlung. messen → die Messung. der Messer is a knife.",
        "das Mädchen stays das because of -chen. Tabletten is only the plural of Tablette. It is not one of these five suffixes."
      ],
      "minutes": 25,
      "vocab": [
        { "de": "Fläschchen", "article": "das", "plural": "die Fläschchen", "en": "little bottle", "emoji": "🍼", "glossaryKey": "fläschchen" },
